      47.97,
      290.49,
      542.5,
      343.56
    ],
    "text": "02. The Mediation Boards Commission hereby gives notice Calling upon (a) the Individuals,(b) the Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of non political nature, and (c) the District Secretaries/ Divisional Secretaries speci\ufb01 ed hereinafter to submit names of person who are eligible for appointment as Mediators to the Panel of Mediators for the said Mediation Board areas:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      360.49,
      542.5,
      385.56
    ],
    "text": "(a) The following Individuals are entitled to submit nominations other than themselves for appointment to the Panel of a particular Mediation Board area:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      402.49,
      542.49,
      441.56
    ],
    "text": "(i) A Public O\ufb03 cer or a Provincial Public O\ufb03 cer serving as the Head of a Department or as the Regional Head of a Department in an o\ufb03 ce located within the Administrative District at which that particular Mediation Board area is situated:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      458.49,
      504.67,
      497.56
    ],
    "text": "(ii) A Head of a Place or religious worship or of school situated in that particular Mediation Board area; (iii) A retired Head of a Department or School Principal residing in that particular Mediation Board area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      514.49,
      233.34,
      525.56
    ],
    "text": "(iv) Chairman of Panel of Mediators.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      542.49,
      542.51,
      623.56
    ],
    "text": "(b) The following Bodies, Organizations and Institutions of Non-political nature are entitled to submit nominations for appointment to the Panel of Mediators of any Mediation Board area: (i) Any board, Organizations or Institution which has been in existence at least for a period of \ufb01 ve years and which is engaged in carrying out or doing anyone or more of the under mentioned objectives;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      631.49,
      497.83,
      642.56
    ],
    "text": "(a) The enhancement of educational, religious, moral or spiritual, advancement of the community.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      650.49,
      369.52,
      661.56
    ],
    "text": "(b) The enhancement of social welfare and eradication of poverty.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      669.49,
      338.54,
      680.56
    ],
    "text": "(c) The enhancement of rural or community development.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      688.49,
      271.6,
      699.56
    ],
    "text": "(d) The enhancement of culture of sports.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      707.49,
      542.49,
      718.56
    ],
    "text": "(e) The enhancement of projects, programmes and activities intending providing and supplying basic needs",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      726.49,
      338.47,
      751.56
    ],
    "text": "of the peoples such as health, food and shelter etc.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      77.59,
      84.31,
      545.04,
      108.67
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2024'07'25P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 25.07.2024 3A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      114.97,
      549.78,
      140.04
    ],
    "text": "(c) The following District Secretaries/Divisional Secretaries are entitled to submit nominations for appointment to the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      156.97,
      507.61,
      168.04
    ],
    "text": "(i) The District Secretaries of the Administrative District in which that Mediation Board area is situated;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      176.97,
      549.77,
      202.04
    ],
    "text": "(ii) As the Following Persons are entitled to be appointed to the Panel of a particular Mediation Board Area whose names may be so submitted for appointment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      218.97,
      496.32,
      230.04
    ],
    "text": "(a) any person being a resident in Mediation Board Area and engaged in any work in that Area;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      242.97,
      549.76,
      268.04
    ],
    "text": "(b) Any person resident or engaged in any work outside that Mediation Board Area, However the Commission is of the opinion that such particular person is eligible in exceptional circumstances; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      280.97,
      549.77,
      320.04
    ],
    "text": "(c) Any Public O\ufb03 cer nominated under this paragraph by the District Secretary of the Administrative District within which that Mediation Board is situated is eligible for appointment to the Panel of Mediators of every Mediation Board area within that Administrative District;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      332.97,
      549.77,
      358.04
    ],
    "text": "(d) The present Chairman, Mediators of Panels of Mediators who are due to vacate post upon the completion of three years.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      370.97,
      549.76,
      396.04
    ],
    "text": "(e) Ful\ufb01 lling of Minimum requirement as G.C.E. (O/L) is being compulsory for the new nominees other then the members those who holding membership of Mediation Boards already.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      408.97,
      549.76,
      434.04
    ],
    "text": "(f) The minimum age limit of those are to forward nominators afresh should be more than 35 years of age save and except the members presently engage in duties.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      446.97,
      549.76,
      486.04
    ],
    "text": "(g) Nominations of those who are engaged in duties in the \ufb01 eld of banking, leasing, micro \ufb01 nancing and insurance involving in \ufb01 nancial activities both in the Government/Semi Government or Private Sector will not be considered.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      55.25,
      502.97,
