    ],
    "text": "03. (a) The Individuals, Boards, Organizations and Institutions referred to in Paragraph 2 above may submit nominations of such persons as are speci\ufb01 ed in Paragraph 2(a) and 2(b) above who are Public and Non-Public O\ufb03 cers including O\ufb03 cers in the Provincial Public Service. Any individual is not entitled to nominate his/her name by himself/herself.",
